TI  - A clinical trial of tang shen ning for treatment of diabetic nephropathy.
PG  - 247-52
AB  - This paper reports the clinical trial of Tang Shen Ning ([symbol: see text], TSN) 
      for treating diabetic nephropathy (incipient and clinical, as divided by 
      Mogensen). The results showed that the total effective rate in treatment group 
      (TSN + western medicine) was 90.0%, and that in the control group (simply with 
      western medicine), 56.7%. TSN plays important roles in decreasing proteinuria and 
      improving renal functions.
