TI  - Is captopril useful in decreasing pleural drainage in children after modified 
      Fontan operation?
PG  - 1109-12, A10
AB  - We performed a retrospective cohort study to assess the relation between 
      administration of angiotensin-converting enzyme inhibitors and duration of 
      pleural drainage in the early postoperative period in patients who underwent a 
      modified Fontan operation at our institution from 1990 through 1996. This study 
      failed to show that administration of captopril decreased the duration of pleural 
      drainage in patients after a modified Fontan operation.
