TI  - Early intervention in patients with heart failure and left ventricular 
      dysfunction.
PG  - 1191-203
AB  - The focus of this article is to review the process of left ventricular remodeling 
      and discuss the results of several published large clinical trials that have 
      demonstrated the benefit of early intervention in heart failure to prevent left 
      ventricular remodeling and progression of cardiac dysfunction. The knowledge 
      gained from this review should help define a strategy for the internist to 
      initiate therapy early in the course of development of heart failure.
